        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It looks down on everyone other than itself. Its\npreferred tactics are sucker punches and\nblindside attacks.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In contrast to its lovely face, it’s so brutal\nthat it tortures its weakened prey rather than\nfinishing them off.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its round face is a symbol of wealth. Persian\nthat have bigger, plumper faces are considered\nmore beautiful.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
